<h2>Dosido 0.11.3</h2>
<ul>
<li>Open a version&#x27;s session folder from the web. When you&#x27;re looking at a version on dosido.app, the File panel shows &quot;Session · Open folder&quot;. Click it and Finder opens the Ableton, Logic, Pro Tools or FL Studio session it was bounced from. Note: this is only available for bounces you make from now on.</li>
<li>Bug fixes and improvements.</li>
</ul>
